  "body": "Fifth production-readiness upgrade, stacked on PR #52.\n\nScope is deliberately limited to **parity scenarios/distribution**.\n\nAdds:\n- `parity_scenarios.json` and `parity_scenarios.feature` derived from the Blueprint's embedded conformance manifest;\n- exactly one static parity scenario for each MAPPED + REQUIRED contract;\n- no scenarios generated from PARTIAL/BLOCKED/UNKNOWN/advisory observations;\n- explicit static-rescan execution class and no runtime/visual/timing equivalence claim;\n- portable regeneration using only the Blueprint, with no original source or SQLite DB required;\n- compact `AGENTS.md` discovery pointer with Blueprint hash and verification command;\n- protection for existing project-authored `AGENTS.md`: SCAN never overwrites it.\n\nAuthority boundary:\n- embedded Blueprint conformance manifest remains authoritative;\n- parity scenarios are derived projections, not an independent specification;\n- candidate self-report has no authority;\n- AGENTS.md is discovery metadata only;\n- runtime parity remains deferred to the later authorized runtime-validation stage.\n\nBroader calibration remains the next independent roadmap stage.",
